Type: Package
Package: dissmapr
Title: Workflow for Compositional Dissimilarity and Biodiversity Turnover Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sandra", "MacFadyen", email = "macfadyen@sun.ac.za",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5316-440X")),
    person("Stellenbosch University", role = "cph"),
    person("European Union", role = "fnd",
           comment = "Horizon Europe grant agreement ID 101059592 (B-Cubed)"))
Description: Tools to compute and map biodiversity turnover at the
    macroscale. 'dissmapr' provides a reproducible, end-to-end workflow
    for computing and mapping compositional dissimilarity and biodiversity
    turnover across large spatial scales, including occurrence-data
    retrieval, environmental-data extraction, flexible grid generation,
    order-wise dissimilarity computation (zeta diversity and multi-site
    generalised dissimilarity modelling) and bioregional mapping.
